WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:05,780
Yeah

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,780
Only after learning the lessons from my previous life did I understand

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,780
no one can really be trusted

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,780
A person walks alone

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,780
On the contrary, it is easier

6
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,780
This is important for my future plans

7
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,780
Also more convenient

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:20,980
This is it

9
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,980
Lin Huijun

10
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,980
Retired teacher from BGI

11
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,980
Want to have a son?

12
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,980
My husband passed away three years ago

13
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,980
From now on I live here alone

14
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:29,980
Hello grandma

15
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,980
Do you know this community?

16
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,180
Are there any houses for rent anywhere?

17
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,180
Girl, what do you do?

18
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,180
I am Huada Sports Body

19
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,180
science students

20
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,180
Because of some personal reasons

21
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,180
I don’t want to live on campus anymore

22
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,180
So I want to find a new place to live nearby.

23
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,180
Even if it’s just one room

24
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,180
But I live as a girl

25
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,180
Just thinking about the school family home

26
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:48,180
Maybe it's relatively safe, girl

27
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,180
The rent here is not cheap

28
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,180
Just the old house in Qinglanyuan

29
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,180
One set costs more than 20,000 per month

30
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,180
Even a room

31
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,180
At least eight thousand

32
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,180
You are a student

33
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,210
Is it affordable?

34
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:00,210
It's a bit unaffordable

35
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:01,210
Sorry grandma

36
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:07,650
Excuse me

37
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:08,650
little girl

38
00:01:08,650 --> 00:01:09,650
You wait

39
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,240
Taken the bait

40
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:16,240
It seems that the family probably doesn't have much money.

41
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,660
Hanmen students

42
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,660
It’s really not easy to get to where we are today

43
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:20,660
Then tell grandma

44
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:21,660
why did you leave it

45
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:23,660
I can’t live in the dormitory that costs 900 yuan a year.

46
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,660
Come out and find a house by yourself

47
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:26,660
I'm preparing for the postgraduate entrance examination

48
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,660
Those who want to study for a graduate degree in sports medicine at BGI

49
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:30,660
Dormitory lights at eleven o'clock

50
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:32,660
But I have too many documents to read

51
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:33,660
Often have to see the early morning

52
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:35,660
Bought a rechargeable desk lamp

53
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:36,660
But there are complaints about the light

54
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:38,660
affect their sleep

55
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:41,650
You see, how many times have we had troubles?

56
00:01:41,650 --> 00:01:43,650
These are the notes I took

57
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:44,650
Everything is a note from a good student

58
00:01:44,650 --> 00:01:46,650
Not like a temporary forgery

59
00:01:46,650 --> 00:01:47,650
I do have a room at home

60
00:01:47,650 --> 00:01:49,650
My daughter used to live there

61
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,650
If you are willing

62
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:51,650
Two thousand a month to rent to you

63
00:01:51,650 --> 00:01:52,650
But you can't do it casually

64
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:53,650
bring friends home
